# MarketMind — all optional. With NONE set, the zero-config demo still works:
# Ask Market + the AI Market Brief run on a live model, and every data route
# degrades to a deterministic mock, with the `source` field reporting provenance
# honestly.

# --- AI / LLM (Wave 3: LIVE by default) --------------------------------------
# Ask Market and the AI Market Brief reason with a real model. Provider order:
#   1. If ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set -> Anthropic Claude (with prompt caching).
#   2. Otherwise -> an OpenAI-compatible endpoint, defaulting to a self-hosted
#      vLLM server running Qwen/Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct (see lib/llm.ts) — live out
#      of the box. On any endpoint error it falls back to the templated analysis.
#
# For a real deployment (Vercel), SET the OpenAI-compatible endpoint so you don't
# depend on an ephemeral RunPod URL (proxy URLs rotate — update when it changes):
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://<your-pod>-8002.proxy.runpod.net/v1
# OPENAI_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct
# OPENAI_API_KEY=runpod-local           # vLLM ignores it; any non-empty value
# AI_BASE_URL / AI_MODEL / AI_API_KEY are accepted as aliases.
#
# ...or use Claude instead:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# --- SoSoValue API -----------------------------------------------------------
# When SOSO_API_KEY is set, news / market / sectors / macro / SSI go LIVE
# (x-soso-api-key header). Without it, deterministic mock is used.
SOSO_API_KEY=
# SOSO_BASE_URL=https://openapi.sosovalue.com/openapi/v1
# SOSO_NEWS_PATH=/news
# SOSO_SECTOR_PATH=/currencies/sector-spotlight
# SOSO_MACRO_PATH=/macro/events
# SOSO_INDICES_PATH=/indices
# SOSO_ETF_PATH=/etfs/summary-history

# --- SoDEX (read-only microstructure) — mock unless a key is present ----------
SODEX_API_KEY=
# SODEX_BASE_URL=https://testnet-gw.sodex.dev/api/v1/spot
